  "system": {
    "finalName": "",
    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Galaxy_of_Intrigue\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue\">Star Wars Saga Edition Galaxy of Intrigue</a></i> </p><p>A Darter is a large pistol that launches a dart by use of a compressed air canister. Although the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> is limited and the damage minor, the darts can deliver <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> or a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surveillance_Tagger\" title=\"Surveillance Tagger\">Surveillance Tagger</a>. Poachers, game wardens, security personnel, assassins, and even medical personnel use Darters in their duties. </p><p>A Darter's maximum range is the Short <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a> increment. A dart carrying <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Poison\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poison\">Poison</a> delivers the toxin if the darter successfully deals damage. </p><p><b>Special:</b>&nbsp;Darters cannot fire at targets at Medium or Long&nbsp;<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Range\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Range\">Range</a>. </p>",
